Package: softridge
Type: Package
Title: High-Dimensional Ridge Shrinkage and Selection by Soft
        Thresholding
Version: 0.3.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohammad", "Arashi", email = "mohammad.arashi@up.ac.za",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Bahadir", "Yuzbasi", role = "aut"))
Description: Implements the soft-thresholded ridge estimator for linear
    regression with more predictors than observations. The estimator has an
    explicit form computed through one singular value decomposition. The
    package provides the exact finite-sample risk under Gaussian errors, the
    Stein unbiased risk estimate with closed-form degrees of freedom, and
    training least-squares rescaling, fixed-scale risk and SURE, and
    tuning by cross-validation or by the unbiased risk estimate. Numerical
    kernels use RcppArmadillo; R interfaces retain the original tuning rules.
    This frozen research build adds internal AR(1) design utilities without
    changing the estimator kernels.
